          "final_text_tail": "Implemented a configurable cleanup timeout for Click\u2019s execution context.\n\n### Key Updates\n- **`src/click/core.py`**\n  - Added `cleanup_timeout` parameter to `Context.__init__` with validation.\n  - Stored the timeout on the context instance.\n  - Modified `Context.close` to respect `cleanup_timeout`:\n    - Performs normal cleanup when no timeout is set.\n    - Executes cleanup in a separate thread with a timeout when specified.\n    - Logs a warning if cleanup exceeds the timeout.\n    - Ensures the exit stack is reset after cleanup.\n\nThese changes allow callers to limit the duration of context teardown, preventing indefinite hangs during `close()` operations.\n",
